  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Clears the pose buffer at $05ca-$07ff and the byte at $0800. Output: X = 0, A = 0."},
    {"at":16,"placement":"line","text":"Builds the image of a pose in the pose buffer at $05ca: 63 lines of 9 bytes, a 3 x 3 grid of sprite-shaped parts. Bytes 0-8 of the pose record at ($89) are the part numbers. A part is 63 bytes at $0800 + 64 * number. 0 = no part. The 0 bytes of a part are transparent. Mirrors the image when fighter $99 faces left ($91,x not 0)."},
    {"at":39,"placement":"side","text":"Buffer address of the part from $ceb6."},
    {"at":61,"placement":"side","text":"Buffer offset of the sprite byte from $cec8."},
    {"at":89,"placement":"line","text":"Mirrors the pose buffer horizontally: it reverses the 9 bytes of each line and mirrors each byte through the table at $02aa."}
  ],
